{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212250","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121225001:1":{"text":"一、二、三……乗るのはそこの三人のお嬢さんたちだけか？隣のメイジさんは？","source_cn":"一、二、三……只有这三位姑娘乘船吗？那边的魔法师，你上不上？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23B4F35722882142","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"一、二、三……乗るのはそこの三人のお嬢さんたちだけか？隣のメイジさんは？","female":"一、二、三……乗るのはそこの三人のお嬢さんたちだけか？隣のメイジさんは？","variant_male_record_index":"117206","variant_female_record_index":"117207","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1121225001":{"text":"一、二、三……乗るのはそこの三人のお嬢さんたちだけか？隣のメイジさんは？","source_cn":"一、二、三……只有这三位姑娘乘船吗？那边的魔法师，你上不上？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23B4F35722882142","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"一、二、三……乗るのはそこの三人のお嬢さんたちだけか？隣のメイジさんは？","female":"一、二、三……乗るのはそこの三人のお嬢さんたちだけか？隣のメイジさんは？","variant_male_record_index":"117206","variant_female_record_index":"117207","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121225002:1":{"text":"あいよ。","source_cn":"好嘞。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1BBB24524483EE5C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あいよ。","female":"あいよ。","variant_male_record_index":"117208","variant_female_record_index":"117209","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121225004:0":{"text":"なら、全部で四人だな。もう出航するから、ちゃんと座っとけよ。","source_cn":"那总共是四个人，坐好吧，我们马上出发。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4120BBE7AD26DDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121225005:0":{"text":"まだだめ。","source_cn":"现在不能走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2E1C35CCC7ACB00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121225006:0":{"text":"あん？船を降りるのか？","source_cn":"啊？你又不坐船了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4F4AFEB6DDE0E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121225007:0":{"text":"大雨が降る。今出航したら、あぶない。","source_cn":"要下大雨了。这时候出航，有危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C7393D22FDB3BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121225008:0":{"text":"はぁ？こんなに晴れてるのに、何を言ってんだ？","source_cn":"胡说八道……这大晴天的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E15DD2FBE29397F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121225009:0":{"text":"本当だよ。もうすぐ、雨雲がやって来る。","source_cn":"我没有胡说，乌云很快就要来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42335B95DA0C2DDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121225010:0":{"text":"分かった分かった……降りたいなら勝手に降りろ。商売の邪魔をするんじゃ――","source_cn":"行行行……你爱坐不坐，不坐就快下船，别耽误我挣钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F87590AE0F37764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121225011:1":{"text":"待ってください……雨が……","source_cn":"等等……真的下雨了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24EA290F075A6683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121225012:0":{"text":"あらら！なんて大きな雨雲かしら！","source_cn":"啊哦！好厚的一坨乌云。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43FD5B19CDAF10B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121225013:0":{"text":"いったんどこかで雨宿りしましょ。髪が濡れるのは勘弁だわ。","source_cn":"我们还是找个地方避避雨吧，我可不想弄湿自己的毛发。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8F12C7B187EF29D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:18:1121225014:1":{"text":"しばらくして……雨がやんだ。","source_cn":"一段时间后……雨停了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x111E71102ED83E32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121225015:0":{"text":"こりゃあ、土砂降りだな……出航しなくてよかったぜ。","source_cn":"呼，这雨真不小……幸好刚才没走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E8F9C74F154ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121225016:0":{"t